//canopticon.com/\",\"name\":\"CANOPTICON\",\"description\":\"A forensic intelligence publication system. Sourced claims, signed analysis, a typed graph of verified facts. Every assertion ties back to a verbatim quote from a stored source document.\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://canopticon.com/#org\"}},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://canopticon.com/#org\",\"name\":\"CANOPTICON\",\"url\":\"https://canopticon.com/\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://twitter.com/canoptics\"]}]}</script>\n<div class=\"hero\">\n  <span class=\"kicker\"><span class=\"live\"></span>THE STANDING RECORD — LIVE</span>\n  <h1><a href=\"/s/canadian-polling-industry?mode=signed\">Canadian polling industry</a></h1>\n  <p class=\"thesis\">The Canadian polling industry operates with relatively weak oversight and a dominant market player.</p>\n  <div class=\"coord\">SUBJECT · SIGNED ANALYSIS ON FILE</div>\n  <div class=\"hero-cta\">\n    <a class=\"btn primary\" href=\"/s/canadian-polling-industry?mode=signed\">Read the signed analysis <span class=\"arr\">→</span></a>\n    <a class=\"btn\" href=\"/topics\">Browse the record <span class=\"arr\">→</span></a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"depth\">\n  <div class=\"cell\"><div class=\"n\">4558</div><div class=\"k label\">Subjects on file</div></div>\n  <div class=\"cell\"><div class=\"n\">116</div><div class=\"k label\">Source documents stored</div></div>\n  <div class=\"cell\"><div class=\"n\">5870</div><div class=\"k label\">Documented facts, each with its quote</div></div>\n  <div class=\"cell killed\"><div class=\"n\">154</div><div class=\"k label\">Claims removed — failed verification</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"sec\">\n  <div class=\"sec-h\"><span class=\"label\">Latest evidence</span><span class=\"coord\">MOST RECENT FIRST</span></div>\n  <a class=\"ev-row\" href=\"/library/research-brief-net-zero-and-carbon-credit-finance-2026-07-24\">\n  <div><div class=\"et\">Research brief: Net-zero and carbon-credit finance (2026-0